 in student jobs on campus and needs to earn money to help pay for her college tuition.\n\n2.**Step-by-Step Analysis:**.\n   - Since Mary works in student jobs on campus, she needs to earn money to help pay for her college tuition (from the first piece of information).\n   - Therefore, Mary orders takeout frequently in college (from the second piece of information).Mary is a picky eater and does not spend a lot of her time eating and catching up with friends in the campus dining halls.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
