Option B (False):** James\'s favorite season is not fall.Based on the information provided, James\'s favorite season is most likely not fall, as he cannot love summer and must love either Spring, Fall, or Winter due to wanting a long vacation. We can only conclude that his favorite season is uncertain, not specifically fall.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
