le who spill a lot of food on their clothing do not tidy their spaces consistently and enjoy the process of cleaning.\n     - People who grew up as only children with no siblings tidy their spaces consistently and enjoy the process of cleaning.\n     - Therefore, Peter would not tidy his space consistently and would not enjoy the process of cleaning.\n   - **Scenario 2:** Peter does not spill a lot of food on his clothing and did not grow up as an only child with no siblings.\n     - According to the context, people who do not spill a lot of food on their clothing tidy their spaces consistently and enjoy the process of cleaning.\n     - People who grew up with siblings tidy their spaces consistently and enjoy the process of cleaning.\n     - Therefore, Peter would tidy his space consistently and would enjoy the process of cleaning.\n\nBased on the above information, the statement "Peter tidies his space consistently and enjoys the process of cleaning" is uncertain.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
